  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a.i\"><p><strong>a.i</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{12.0}{0.800}=15.0yrs\"></span> ✔</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a.ii\"><p><strong>a.ii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-0.8^{2}}}\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma=\\frac{5}{3}\"></span> ✔ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=\\frac{15}{\\gamma}=9.00yrs\"></span> ✔ Allow ECF from MP1</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.i\"><p><strong>b.i</strong></p><p>the length of an object in the object’s rest frame ✔</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.ii\"><p><strong>b.ii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{-0.800c-0.600c}{1+\\frac{0.800c\\times 0.600c}{c^{2}}}\"></span> ✔ «<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>0.946c » Correct substitution<br/>Allow positive values in the numerator</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.iii\"><p><strong>b.iii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-0.946^{2}}}\"></span> OR  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma=3.08\"></span> ✔ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L=\\frac{992}{\\gamma}=322 m\"></span> ✔ Allow ECF from MP1</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.i\"><p><strong>c.i</strong></p><p>45 degree line to the right from F ✔<br/>intersecting vertical line from B ✔ eg:<br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_04\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 4\" src=\"asset:fig_04\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.ii\"><p><strong>c.ii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Δ t ' = 3.08 \\times  ( \\frac{922}{c} + \\frac{0.946 \\times  992}{c} )\"></span> ✔ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>1.98<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span>10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\"></span><sup>5</sup> « s » ✔</p></section>"
